  "title": "Main dialog: Wireshark stops extcap on exit if no packets received yet",
  "description": "There is corner case which involves use of extcap:\n- Capture is running with extcap\n- No packet is captured yet\n- User closes main Wireshark window\n\nIn this case extcap is not stopped and main wireshark process hangs.\n\nThe patch stops capture in this case which triggers stop of extcap. User must\nreissue close of window again.\n\nFixes: #17781",
